  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FCDO economist deployment to UN agencies</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The UK&#x2019;s intent to work with partners (including WFP and UNHCR) to finding and advocating for sustainable solutions for supporting refugees. The UK supports the deployment as well of FCDO statistician into UNHCR and support WFP on the Refugee Skills Census (currently underway). In addition to the deployment of FCDO economist to UNICEF.</narrative>
  </description>
